# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Appendix: Krylov subspace from real time-evolutions {#appendix-krylov-subspace-from-real-time-evolutions}"
msgstr "Lampiran: Subruang Krylov dari evolusi masa nyata {#appendix-krylov-subspace-from-real-time-evolutions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The unitary Krylov space is defined as\n"
msgstr "Ruang Krylov unitari ditakrifkan sebagai\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{K}_U(H, |\\psi\\rangle) = \\text{span}\\left\\{ |\\psi\\rangle,  e^{-iH\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, \\dots, e^{-irH\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle \\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{K}_U(H, |\\psi\\rangle) = \\text{span}\\left\\{ |\\psi\\rangle,  e^{-iH\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, \\dots, e^{-irH\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle \\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for some timestep $dt$ that we will determine later. Temporarily assume $r$ is even: then define $d=r/2$. Notice that when we project the Hamiltonian into the Krylov space above, it is indistinguishable from the Krylov space\n"
msgstr "untuk suatu langkah masa $dt$ yang akan kita tentukan kemudian. Buat masa ini anggap $r$ adalah genap: kemudian takrifkan $d=r/2$. Perhatikan bahawa apabila kita mengunjur Hamiltonian ke dalam ruang Krylov di atas, ia tidak dapat dibezakan daripada ruang Krylov\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{K}_U(H, |\\psi\\rangle) = \\text{span}\\left\\{ e^{i\\,d\\,H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle,  e^{i(d-1)H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, \\dots, e^{-i(d-1)H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, e^{-i\\,d\\,H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle \\right\\},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{K}_U(H, |\\psi\\rangle) = \\text{span}\\left\\{ e^{i\\,d\\,H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle,  e^{i(d-1)H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, \\dots, e^{-i(d-1)H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, e^{-i\\,d\\,H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle \\right\\},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"that is, where all the time-evolutions are shifted backward by $d$ timesteps.\n"
"The reason it is indistinguishable is because the matrix elements\n"
msgstr ""
"iaitu, di mana semua evolusi masa dianjak ke belakang sebanyak $d$ langkah masa.\n"
"Sebab ia tidak dapat dibezakan ialah kerana elemen matriks\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\tilde{H}_{j,k} = \\langle\\psi|e^{i\\,j\\,H\\,dt}He^{-i\\,k\\,H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle=\\langle\\psi|He^{i(j-k)H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\tilde{H}_{j,k} = \\langle\\psi|e^{i\\,j\\,H\\,dt}He^{-i\\,k\\,H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle=\\langle\\psi|He^{i(j-k)H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "are invariant under overall shifts of the evolution time, since the time-evolutions commute with the Hamiltonian. For odd $r$, we can use the analysis for $r-1$.\n"
msgstr "adalah tidak berubah di bawah anjakan keseluruhan masa evolusi, memandangkan evolusi masa bertukar ganti dengan Hamiltonian. Untuk $r$ ganjil, kita boleh guna analisis untuk $r-1$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We want to show that somewhere in this Krylov space, there is guaranteed to be a low-energy state. We do so by way of the following result, which is derived from Theorem 3.1 in [\\[3\\]](#references):\n"
msgstr "Kita ingin menunjukkan bahawa di suatu tempat dalam ruang Krylov ini, terdapat jaminan wujudnya keadaan tenaga rendah. Kita berbuat demikian melalui hasil berikut, yang diterbitkan daripada Teorem 3.1 dalam [\\[3\\]](#references):\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Claim 1:** there exists a function $f$ such that for energies $E$ in the spectral range of the Hamiltonian (that is, between the ground state energy and the maximum energy)...\n"
"1. $f(E_0)=1$\n"
"2. $|f(E)|\\le2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-d}$ for all values of $E$ that lie $\\ge\\delta$ away from $E_0$, that is, it is exponentially suppressed\n"
"3. $f(E)$ is a linear combination of $e^{ijE\\,dt}$ for $j=-d,-d+1,...,d-1,d$\n"
msgstr ""
"**Tuntutan 1:** terdapat fungsi $f$ supaya untuk tenaga $E$ dalam julat spektral Hamiltonian (iaitu, antara tenaga keadaan asas dan tenaga maksimum)...\n"
"1. $f(E_0)=1$\n"
"2. $|f(E)|\\le2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-d}$ untuk semua nilai $E$ yang terletak $\\ge\\delta$ jauh dari $E_0$, iaitu, ia ditekan secara eksponen\n"
"3. $f(E)$ adalah gabungan linear $e^{ijE\\,dt}$ untuk $j=-d,-d+1,...,d-1,d$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We give a proof below, but that can be safely skipped unless one wants to understand the full, rigorous argument. For now we focus on the implications of the above claim. By property 3 above, we can see that the shifted Krylov space above contains the state $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$. This is our low-energy state. To see why, write $|\\psi\\rangle$ in the energy eigenbasis:\n"
msgstr "Kami berikan bukti di bawah, tetapi itu boleh dilangkau dengan selamat kecuali seseorang ingin memahami hujah yang penuh dan ketat. Buat masa ini kita tumpukan pada implikasi tuntutan di atas. Melalui sifat 3 di atas, kita dapat melihat bahawa ruang Krylov yang dianjak di atas mengandungi keadaan $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$. Inilah keadaan tenaga rendah kita. Untuk memahami kenapa, tulis $|\\psi\\rangle$ dalam asas eigen tenaga:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle = \\sum_{k=0}^{N}\\gamma_k|E_k\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle = \\sum_{k=0}^{N}\\gamma_k|E_k\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "where $|E_k\\rangle$ is the kth energy eigenstate and $\\gamma_k$ is its amplitude in the initial state $|\\psi\\rangle$. Expressed in terms of this, $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$ is given by\n"
msgstr "di mana $|E_k\\rangle$ adalah keadaan eigen tenaga ke-k dan $\\gamma_k$ adalah amplitudnya dalam keadaan awal $|\\psi\\rangle$. Dinyatakan dalam bentuk ini, $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$ diberikan oleh\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"f(H)|\\psi\\rangle = \\sum_{k=0}^{N}\\gamma_kf(E_k)|E_k\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"f(H)|\\psi\\rangle = \\sum_{k=0}^{N}\\gamma_kf(E_k)|E_k\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "using the fact that we can replace $H$ by $E_k$ when it acts on the eigenstate $|E_k\\rangle$. The energy error of this state is therefore\n"
msgstr "menggunakan fakta bahawa kita boleh gantikan $H$ dengan $E_k$ apabila ia bertindak pada keadaan eigen $|E_k\\rangle$. Ralat tenaga bagi keadaan ini oleh itu ialah\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} = \\frac{\\langle\\psi|f(H)(H-E_0)f(H)|\\psi\\rangle}{\\langle\\psi|f(H)^2|\\psi\\rangle}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} = \\frac{\\langle\\psi|f(H)(H-E_0)f(H)|\\psi\\rangle}{\\langle\\psi|f(H)^2|\\psi\\rangle}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"= \\frac{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"= \\frac{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To turn this into an upper bound that is easier to understand, we first separate the sum in the numerator into terms with $E_k-E_0\\le\\delta$ and terms with $E_k-E_0>\\delta$:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengubah ini menjadi batas atas yang lebih mudah difahami, kita mula-mula asingkan jumlah dalam pengangka kepada sebutan dengan $E_k-E_0\\le\\delta$ dan sebutan dengan $E_k-E_0>\\delta$:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} = \\frac{\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} + \\frac{\\sum_{E_k> E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} = \\frac{\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} + \\frac{\\sum_{E_k> E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We can upper bound the first term by $\\delta$,\n"
msgstr "Kita boleh batas atas sebutan pertama dengan $\\delta$,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} < \\frac{\\delta\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} \\le \\delta,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} < \\frac{\\delta\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} \\le \\delta,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "where the first step follows because $E_k-E_0\\le\\delta$ for every $E_k$ in the sum, and the second step follows because the sum in the numerator is a subset of the sum in the denominator. For the second term, first we lower bound the denominator by $|\\gamma_0|^2$, since $f(E_0)^2=1$: adding everything back together, this gives\n"
msgstr "di mana langkah pertama mengikut kerana $E_k-E_0\\le\\delta$ untuk setiap $E_k$ dalam jumlah tersebut, dan langkah kedua mengikut kerana jumlah dalam pengangka adalah subset daripada jumlah dalam penyebut. Untuk sebutan kedua, pertama kita batas bawah penyebut dengan $|\\gamma_0|^2$, memandangkan $f(E_0)^2=1$: dengan menggabungkan semua ini semula, ini memberikan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} \\le \\delta + \\frac{1}{|\\gamma_0|^2}\\sum_{E_k>E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} \\le \\delta + \\frac{1}{|\\gamma_0|^2}\\sum_{E_k>E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To simplify what is left, notice that for all these $E_k$, by the definition of $f$ we know that $f(E_k)^2 \\le 4\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-2d}$. Additionally upper bounding $E_k-E_0<2\\|H\\|$ and upper bounding $\\sum_{E_k>E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2<1$ gives\n"
msgstr "Untuk memudahkan apa yang tinggal, perhatikan bahawa untuk semua $E_k$ ini, mengikut definisi $f$ kita tahu bahawa $f(E_k)^2 \\le 4\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-2d}$. Dengan tambahan membatas atas $E_k-E_0<2\\|H\\|$ dan membatas atas $\\sum_{E_k>E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2<1$ memberikan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} \\le \\delta + \\frac{8}{|\\gamma_0|^2}\\|H\\|\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-2d}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} \\le \\delta + \\frac{8}{|\\gamma_0|^2}\\|H\\|\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-2d}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This holds for any $\\delta>0$, so if we set $\\delta$ equal to our goal error, then the error bound above converges towards that exponentially with the Krylov dimension $2d=r$. Also note that if $\\delta<E_1-E_0$ then the $\\delta$ term actually goes away entirely in the above bound.\n"
msgstr "Ini berlaku untuk sebarang $\\delta>0$, jadi jika kita tetapkan $\\delta$ sama dengan ralat sasaran kita, maka batas ralat di atas menumpu ke arah itu secara eksponen dengan dimensi Krylov $2d=r$. Perhatikan juga bahawa jika $\\delta<E_1-E_0$ maka sebutan $\\delta$ sebenarnya hilang sama sekali dalam batas di atas.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To complete the argument, we first note that the above is just the energy error of the particular state $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$, rather than the energy error of the lowest energy state in the Krylov space. However, by the (Rayleigh-Ritz) variational principle, the energy error of the lowest energy state in the Krylov space is upper bounded by the energy error of any state in the Krylov space, so the above is also an upper bound on the energy error of the lowest energy state, that is, the output of the Krylov quantum diagonalization algorithm.\n"
msgstr "Untuk melengkapkan hujah, kita mula-mula ambil perhatian bahawa yang di atas hanyalah ralat tenaga bagi keadaan tertentu $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$, bukan ralat tenaga keadaan tenaga terendah dalam ruang Krylov. Walau bagaimanapun, melalui prinsip variasi (Rayleigh-Ritz), ralat tenaga keadaan tenaga terendah dalam ruang Krylov dibatas atas oleh ralat tenaga mana-mana keadaan dalam ruang Krylov, jadi yang di atas juga merupakan batas atas bagi ralat tenaga keadaan tenaga terendah, iaitu, output algoritma pepenjuru kuantum Krylov.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "A similar analysis as the above can be carried out that additionally accounts for noise and the thresholding procedure discussed in the notebook. See [\\[2\\]](#references) and [\\[4\\]](#references) for this analysis.\n"
msgstr "Analisis yang serupa dengan di atas boleh dijalankan yang juga mengambil kira hingar dan prosedur penempatan ambang yang dibincangkan dalam notebook. Lihat [\\[2\\]](#references) dan [\\[4\\]](#references) untuk analisis ini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Appendix: proof of Claim 1 {#appendix-proof-of-claim-1}"
msgstr "Lampiran: bukti Tuntutan 1 {#appendix-proof-of-claim-1}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following is mostly derived from [\\[3\\]](#references), Theorem 3.1: let $ 0 < a < b $ and let $ \\Pi^*_d $ be the space of residual polynomials (polynomials whose value at 0 is 1) of degree at most $ d $. The solution to\n"
msgstr "Berikut ini kebanyakannya diterbitkan daripada [\\[3\\]](#references), Teorem 3.1: biar $ 0 < a < b $ dan biar $ \\Pi^*_d $ adalah ruang polinomial residu (polinomial yang nilainya pada 0 ialah 1) berdarjah paling banyak $ d $. Penyelesaian kepada\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\beta(a, b, d) = \\min_{p \\in \\Pi^*_d} \\max_{x \\in [a, b]} |p(x)| \\quad\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\beta(a, b, d) = \\min_{p \\in \\Pi^*_d} \\max_{x \\in [a, b]} |p(x)| \\quad\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "is\n"
msgstr "ialah\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"p^*(x) = \\frac{T_d\\left(\\frac{b + a - 2x}{b - a}\\right)}{T_d\\left(\\frac{b + a}{b - a}\\right)}, \\quad\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"p^*(x) = \\frac{T_d\\left(\\frac{b + a - 2x}{b - a}\\right)}{T_d\\left(\\frac{b + a}{b - a}\\right)}, \\quad\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and the corresponding minimal value is\n"
msgstr "dan nilai minimum yang sepadan ialah\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\beta(a, b, d) = T_d^{-1}\\left(\\frac{b + a}{b - a}\\right).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\beta(a, b, d) = T_d^{-1}\\left(\\frac{b + a}{b - a}\\right).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We want to convert this into a function that can be expressed naturally in terms of complex exponentials, because those are the real time-evolutions that generate the quantum Krylov space.\n"
"To do so, it is convenient to introduce the following transformation of energies within the spectral range of the Hamiltonian to numbers in the range $[0,1]$: define\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita ingin mengubah ini kepada fungsi yang boleh dinyatakan secara semula jadi dalam bentuk eksponen kompleks, kerana itulah evolusi masa nyata yang menjana ruang Krylov kuantum.\n"
"Untuk berbuat demikian, adalah mudah untuk memperkenalkan transformasi tenaga dalam julat spektral Hamiltonian berikut kepada nombor dalam julat $[0,1]$: takrifkan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"g(E) = \\frac{1-\\cos\\big((E-E_0)dt\\big)}{2},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"g(E) = \\frac{1-\\cos\\big((E-E_0)dt\\big)}{2},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $dt$ is a timestep such that $-\\pi < E_0dt < E_\\text{max}dt < \\pi$.\n"
"Notice that $g(E_0)=0$ and $g(E)$ grows as $E$ moves away from $E_0$.\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $dt$ adalah langkah masa supaya $-\\pi < E_0dt < E_\\text{max}dt < \\pi$.\n"
"Perhatikan bahawa $g(E_0)=0$ dan $g(E)$ meningkat apabila $E$ bergerak menjauhi $E_0$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Now using the polynomial $p^*(x)$ with the parameters a, b, d set to $a = g(E_0 + \\delta)$, $b = 1$, and d = int(r/2), we define the function:\n"
msgstr "Sekarang menggunakan polinomial $p^*(x)$ dengan parameter a, b, d ditetapkan kepada $a = g(E_0 + \\delta)$, $b = 1$, dan d = int(r/2), kita takrifkan fungsi:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"f(E) = p^* \\left( g(E) \\right) = \\frac{T_d\\left(1 + 2\\frac{\\cos\\big((E-E_0)dt\\big) - \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 +\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)}{T_d\\left(1 + 2\\frac{1-\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 + \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"f(E) = p^* \\left( g(E) \\right) = \\frac{T_d\\left(1 + 2\\frac{\\cos\\big((E-E_0)dt\\big) - \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 +\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)}{T_d\\left(1 + 2\\frac{1-\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 + \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "where $E_0$ is the ground state energy. We can see by inserting $\\cos(x)=\\frac{e^{ix}+e^{-ix}}{2}$ that $f(E)$ is a trigonometric polynomial of degree $d$, that is, a linear combination of $e^{ijE\\,dt}$ for $j=-d,-d+1,...,d-1,d$. Furthermore, from the definition of $p^*(x)$ above we have that $f(E_0)=p(0)=1$ and for any $E$ in the spectral range such that $\\vert E-E_0 \\vert > \\delta$ we have\n"
msgstr "di mana $E_0$ adalah tenaga keadaan asas. Kita dapat lihat dengan memasukkan $\\cos(x)=\\frac{e^{ix}+e^{-ix}}{2}$ bahawa $f(E)$ adalah polinomial trigonometri berdarjah $d$, iaitu, gabungan linear $e^{ijE\\,dt}$ untuk $j=-d,-d+1,...,d-1,d$. Tambahan pula, daripada definisi $p^*(x)$ di atas kita ada bahawa $f(E_0)=p(0)=1$ dan untuk sebarang $E$ dalam julat spektral sedemikian rupa sehingga $\\vert E-E_0 \\vert > \\delta$ kita ada\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|f(E)| \\le \\beta(a, b, d) = T_d^{-1}\\left(1 + 2\\frac{1-\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 + \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|f(E)| \\le \\beta(a, b, d) = T_d^{-1}\\left(1 + 2\\frac{1-\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 + \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\leq 2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-d} = 2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-\\lfloor k/2\\rfloor}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\leq 2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-d} = 2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-\\lfloor k/2\\rfloor}.\n"
"$$\n"

